{"v":3,"catch":"點燃《保齡狂潮》，讓情緒隨之沸騰吧！","desc":"沉浸在《保齡狂潮》的世界中吧！\n\n造訪逼真無比的3D場景，暢玩精彩的小遊戲，在無數遊戲模式中測試你的技能，並發現數十種全新的保齡球與球瓶！\n\n需要幫忙嗎？各種強化道具與將會助你一臂之力。\n\n從未有過如此精彩刺激的保齡球遊戲！\n\n-來自世界各地的夢幻保齡球館。\n-20種以上的酷炫保齡球、球瓶與球道供你挑選！\n-多種小遊戲等你完成。\n-多種遊戲模式任你挑戰！","publisher":"Baltoro Minis","release":"2025-12-04","genres":["街機","模擬","運動","動作"],"players":"單機 1–4 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","義大利文","韓文","中文 (繁體)"],"pmax":4,"poff":4,"rating":"普遍級","size":"Switch 2 0.6GB / Switch 0.6GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/0b87096ee43b2995c483b7376e4a20a53e58c85ae19c4401a420374a6954d7e7.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/1f8af826ae228251a9c0229322b7cc7394ca7686be2f04c9f662980792815588.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/49c044849ecb3a1cd969110e6c461cf9e85eeba4ad6a6fe549a4d5c2333e42a1.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/c1ad8bdca29000fda7f8bbedb7fbe9691292fab2cc4f77d97c13383e1fdd80d3.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/1331b837e3ff53b88f64205e940cf1b74f55e82bb166cebf4599bee9e48e58a4.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/3d1727f8f34517fd515ae1e75e9a8c12beb1043f6b6badc8af94d7a631cf54ed.jpg"],"titleId":"010077701d772000","dlc":[{"id":"70050000066845","name":"Bowling Fever 保齡狂潮 Expansion Pack","img":"adc40a1af5bdd3fae8fa05b12766f1e51efc84551b0b40d5839b0f6851df77ea","date":"2025-12-04","mem":false},{"id":"70050000066846","name":"Bowling Fever 保齡狂潮 Expansion Pack #2","img":"3d9108ed91481c4d91c3e7140a89ea6ef16bd18ccb6c1811fe9120a4af272fc8","date":"2025-12-04","mem":false},{"id":"70050000066847","name":"Bowling Fever 保齡狂潮 Expansion Pack #3","img":"13d0fe3b9e3e2ff149d44cd6c8f389fd69f0590d77535367898006b28d926074","date":"2025-12-04","mem":false},{"id":"70050000066848","name":"Bowling Fever 保齡狂潮 Expansion Pack #4","img":"85e6c0d08209f1d3d6698b7f318eaec292445d2cabeeca4a1f6497d02ab90deb","date":"2025-12-04","mem":false},{"id":"70050000066849","name":"Bowling Fever 保齡狂潮 Expansion Pack #5","img":"59d8e5ec2bde775d936690645a4fd14f